{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_title", "source_sha256": "6fcb8c3fa148f1684032d4f2dabfa41b6c00a264378890a62f37b6b728a42cf9", "ja": "ライブMC　～会場には迷わず馬車で～", "zh": "演唱会主持　～来会场就是要坐马车～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "28e7656f27180d378bbc38924114a8b8019baa25768b5097d03868f793450582", "ja": "公演が楽しみで早く家を出たが、時間ギリギ\nリになってしまったと話すあずさ。一方、\n馬車でやってきたというまつりに、乗ってみ\nたいとはしゃぐ麗花。いつまでも思い出に残\nる素敵な公演にすることを誓うアイドル達。", "zh": "梓说她很期待公演所以提早出门，结果却\n在最后一刻才到。另一方面，丽花听到茉莉是\n搭马车过来的，兴奋地表示她也想坐坐看。\n偶像们发誓要带来精彩无比的公演，在大家的\n回忆中留下永远的印记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "9ca8be0171d2eba8a4e16805ca2895149b1e881045058fde18ae74a31b20515c", "ja": "はいほー！　姫たちのパーティーにようこそなのです！\n姫はこの日を、とっても楽しみにしてたのですよー！", "zh": "Hi Ho！欢迎来到公主我们的派对的喔！\n公主非常期待这一天的到来的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "ea48fcb7d2da06e624f650010e67d8eaf4f967d0fe28d60d747fa56ceda71f57", "ja": "私も、とっても楽しみでしたー！　それで、遅刻しない\nように、1時間も早く家を出たんですけど……。", "zh": "我也超期待～！而且为了不要迟到，\n我还提早一小时出门……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "1e51f5ef0d90ee16c9fd7767027a9b96050b891488d0da688a59d6894360386e", "ja": "気がついたら、知らない場所にいて……。\nあ、でも、時間ギリギリに到着できました～！", "zh": "结果等我发现的时候，人已经到了陌生的地方……\n啊，不过，我成功赶在最后一刻到达了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "8470306f520517caee00e3c47f3760b9243ada1db1e0946ba85a3d2989426382", "ja": "そ、それは大変でしたわね。\nでも、よくそこから、その……あずさおひとりで……？", "zh": "那、那还真是惨呢。\n不过，真亏梓能从那里，呃……一个人过来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "3877259c415edee8acc4ff98b508b941a98afa827216ce4a520148debf775481", "ja": "私と来たんだよ！　スキップでルンルンって寄り道\nしてたら、あずささんがいてビックリしちゃった♪", "zh": "她跟我一起来的！我一边小跳步一边开心哼着歌，\n结果走着走着就看到梓，吓了我一跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e0953a174684bfcecd5e59c04b1303131964e6b9bd76a034f771da969d3b100", "ja": "なるほどなのです！　ちなみに姫は、\nカボチャの馬車に乗ってきたのですよ♪", "zh": "原来如此的呀！顺带一提，\n公主是坐南瓜马车过来的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "3a96e6db66e1d1e18066e66d81dc6cc8101fa6fb48b2cb72490a2e3b4674678a", "ja": "すごいすごーい！　いいないいな、私も乗りたいな～♪\n千鶴ちゃんも乗りたいよね？", "zh": "好棒好棒～！好好喔～我也好想坐喔～♪\n小千鹤也想坐对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "17019aba098d6709a24c3aecf4700c83fe3d8a8420f025c754022b9e707cf32f", "ja": "そうですわね。……はっ！　も、もちろん、\n我が家の馬車との違いを楽しむために、ですけれど！", "zh": "是啊……啊！这、这当然是为了\n享受和本小姐家马车的不同之处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1010_audience", "source_sha256": "5801286782226b57902dc0f4b96da11330009a9e10b2c32b273f2d3a5bacb09d", "ja": "オオ……！", "zh": "哦哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "f260a041bdf50517be0fd9a711270573414a294b864a66efea25467345eca735", "ja": "ですが、今は馬車と同じくらい……\nみなさまと一緒に公演を楽しみたいと思っていますわ！", "zh": "不过，和想坐马车的心情一样……\n本小姐现在也想和各位一起享受公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1012_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "0ab488993cc8a2c271d7d729e3fb874abdcfc66a42eeede5cb4e3fd9120a4ef1", "ja": "姫もなのです！　ふわふわな魔法を会場にかけて、\nとびきり・わんだほー！なライブをお届けしますよー！", "zh": "公主也是的喔！公主要在会场施展轻飘飘的魔法，\n为大家送上超级美妙的演唱会唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "290634d8f5d82a7c975b1e29aeaba1bdfc064e12bca1ed33304655c99a15271c", "ja": "うふふ、いつになっても思い出せるような、\nそんな素敵な公演にしましょうね～！", "zh": "唔呵呵，我们一起打造出最棒的公演，\n让大家永远不会忘记吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1015_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "dda67541895020c6d81d7091647637deddeb81a36211abc0fe7453370ca9eae5", "ja": "それではそろそろ次の曲にいきましょう！\n麗花、最後にひと言よろしくお願いしますわ！", "zh": "那么差不多该进入下一首歌曲了！\n丽花，最后请你说句话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0092_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0092_story_12_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "de7367caa7e7adf29035a580f9d0398f4329a6f2adb75a499c2508c5aab2e062", "ja": "任されました！　みんな、私がよーいって言ったら、\nどーん！って返してね。次の曲へ、よーい……どーん！", "zh": "交给我！大家～我说「预～备」之后，\n你们就回我「开始！」。下一首歌曲，预～备……开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
